<title>THAILAND: Thai Nov trade deficit narrows to 24.2 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Nov trade deficit narrows to 24.2 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that Thailand's November trade deficit narrowed to 24.2 billion baht from a revised 36.2 billion deficit in October and against a deficit of 38.5 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE     Nov 96     Oct 96	 Nov 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     120.8	116.4	  128.3</p>
<p>	  Imports	     145.0	152.6	  166.8</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -24.2	-36.2	  -38.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-252-9950</p>
</text>
